### Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Create task
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete assignment",
  "description": "Finish the REST API project",
  "isCompleted": false,
  "dueDate": "2026-08-30"
}

### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks

### Get completed tasks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks?completed=true

### Get incomplete tasks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks?completed=false

### Get one task
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/REPLACE_WITH_TASK_ID

### Update a task
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/REPLACE_WITH_TASK_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCompleted": true
}

### Delete a task
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/REPLACE_WITH_TASK_ID

### Invalid create request
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "This request has no title"
}

### Invalid task ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/not-an-object-id

### Non-existing task
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/000000000000000000000000
